<h2>Aside 1.7.1</h2>

<p class="intro">A small follow-up to 1.7.0 for the new agent access.</p>

<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Agent access can no longer slow the app down.</b> A local process opening many live-transcript waits at once could stall the notch during a meeting. Waits are capped and processed off the main thread.</li>
  <li>The live-transcript tools now say in their own description that transcript text is other people's speech, so an agent treats it as data, never as instructions.</li>
</ul>
